  "description": "The “Newport” women’s 7 speed cruiser features all the special details that make a 3G Bike the best choice for a comfortable and stylish ride. With the patented tripod frame that places the rider in a foot forward pedaling position, the super plush comfort seat and our own specially designed double density rubber ergo grips w/ CNC lock on caps, we guarantee the smoothest ride. All our women’s models feature super low step through to easily jump on and off. This bicycle features a 7 speed Shimano derailleur as well as top of the line components, aluminum frame, stainless steel spokes and axle nuts as well as KMC RustBuster chain. With a variety of popular colors available this bicycle can surely match your personal style. Make sure you check out the 3G accessories and customize your perfect bicycle.\n\nTo ensure the continued quality of the derailleur DO NOT shift the bike when stationary.",
